Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Change of moire length: HgCl2/TiTe2", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"25db992a-5c66-f145-b801-050e7157d4ac"],

Cell["\<\
Code for the slides of \"change moire length.pptx\" (HgCl2/TiTe2, spin-up \
block, potential only on the valence band unless stated). Cells are copied \
unchanged from \"change moire length.nb\" (sections 1-3) and \"heavy fermion \
material all.nb\" (section 4); added cells are marked ADDED. Nothing has been \
evaluated here. Momenta in 1/nm; TA = 1/(moire length in nm).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4df94a78-0d57-2c4c-ae30-f8899873dba8"],

C,

